  "feature": "aitp-a2a-agent-card",
  "$comment": "The Agent Card is an A2A 1.0.0 AgentCard (JSON names as in the A2A specification, https://a2a-protocol.org/latest/specification/). `input.agent_card` is the Card as fetched; `input.selected_interface_url` is the AgentInterface the client intends to call; `input.manifest` is the Manifest fetched from the Card's `params.manifestUrl` (inner body; placeholders resolve as for man-*), or `input.manifest_fetch` records a fetch outcome. The runner MUST NOT fetch anything. a2a-007 pins #176 item 15: the byte-for-byte match of step 5 is not enough when the matched entry is not an HTTPS URL.",
  "description": "The Card's only interface is `http://b.agents.example.com/a2a/v1`, and agent B's signed Manifest lists that same string under `rfc-aitp-0014.a2a_interfaces`, so the byte-for-byte match of RFC-AITP-0014 §4.2 step 5 succeeds. The entry is not an HTTPS URL (§4.1, §4.1.1), and §5.1 forbids sending a TCT without TLS. Step 5 ⇒ IDENTITY_FAILED; the client MUST NOT send a TCT there.",
  "tags": [
    "failure",
    "a2a",
    "agent-card",
    "https"
  ],
